abstract: >-
  1,680 sets of 20 social-media ads written by gpt-4.1-mini and claude-haiku-4-5 under six ways of requesting
  variants for 12 briefs, with effective semantic diversity (Vendi score) per set and judge-coded ideas and
  persuasion strategies for 264 sets.
